# Checkbox detection API. Start the server with the "Run API" configuration,
# then run a request below with the ▶ gutter icon (or ⌘⏎ / Ctrl+Enter).
#
# Fixtures come from testdata/; regenerate them with:
#   python3 testdata/gen_fixtures.py
#
# The hm*.png crops and homevision.pdf are the challenge's own sample
# documents and are not committed, so those requests only work on a machine
# that has them. See testdata/README.md.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### An image of a form: 4 checkboxes, the middle two marked
POST {{host}}/detect
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="form.png"

< ./testdata/form.png
--Boundary--

>

### Text and checkboxes on one page: 6 boxes, the 2nd, 3rd and 6th marked
POST {{host}}/detect
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="mixed.pdf"

< ./testdata/mixed.pdf
--Boundary--

>

